# requirements-structure.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Structure summary only, no elaboration
- Updated in real time
- No references to or pointers to other files/entries
- No decision information
- Clean and concise

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Requirements structure / feature implementation structure

### H2 (required)
- Feature structure tree: layered structure (tree)
- Structure registration table: item / level / owner

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Structure change log: date / item / change
